tainer"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.161" end="1:34.382">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:34.382" end="1:34.486">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我并没有什么想说的话</span></p><p begin="1:34.951" end="1:41.195" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.951" end="1:35.193">た</span><span begin="1:35.193" end="1:35.464">だ</span><span begin="1:35.464" end="1:35.575">も</span><span begin="1:35.575" end="1:35.686">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.687" end="1:36.032">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.032" end="1:36.243">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.032" end="1:36.243">ど</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">会</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.243" end="1:36.755">あ</span></span></span><span begin="1:36.755" end="1:37.099">い</span><span begin="1:37.099" end="1:38.404">た</span><span begin="1:38.404" end="1:38.659">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只希望能与你再见一面</span></p><p begin="1:41.195" end="1:43.254" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.195" end="1:41.300">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.300" end="1:41.405">い</span><span begin="1:41.406" end="1:41.580">た</span><span begin="1:41.580" end="1:41.747">い</span><span begin="1:41.747" end="1:41.971">こ</span><span begin="1:41.971" end="1:42.155">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.155" end="1:42.372">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.372" end="1:42.531">え</span><span begin="1:42.531" end="1:42.684">な</span><span begin="1:42.684" end="1:42.851">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我说不出心中想说的话</span></p><p begin="1:43.254" end="1:47.719" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">根</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.254" end="1:43.502">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.254" end="1:43.502">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">性</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.502" end="1:43.764">じょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.764" end="1:44.036">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.764" end="1:44.036">し</span></span></span><span begin="1:44.036" end="1:44.212">し</span><span begin="1:44.212" end="1:44.476">か</span><span begin="1:44.476" end="1:44.621">も</span><span begin="1:44.621" end="1:45.060">し</span><span begin="1:45.060" end="1:45.372">れ</span><span begin="1:45.372" end="1:45.860">な</span><span begin="1:45.860" end="1:46.620">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">或许是因为我太过软弱</span></p><p begin="1:47.719" end="1:49.526" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.719" end="1:47.963">そ</span><span begin="1:47.963" end="1:48.199">れ</span><span begin="1:48.199" end="1:48.501">で</span><span begin="1:48.501" end="1:48.753">い</span><span begin="1:48.753" end="1:49.005">い</span><span begin="1:49.005" end="1:49.253">け</span><span begin="1:49.253" end="1:49.526">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不过我毫不在乎</span></p><p begin="1:49.526" end="1:55.596" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.526" end="1:50.294">も</span><span begin="1:50.294" end="1:50.589">し</span><span begin="1:50.589" end="1:51.061">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">願</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.061" end="1:51.606">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.061" end="1:51.606">が</span></span></span><span begin="1:51.606" end="1:52.133">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.133" end="1:53.141">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.133" end="1:53.141">と</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.141" end="1:53.365">つ</span><span begin="1:53.365" end="1:53.685">だ</span><span begin="1:53.685" end="1:54.337">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果我有一个愿望</span></p><p begin="1:55.596" end="1:57.884" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">叶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.596" end="1:56.324">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.596" end="1:56.324">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.324" end="1:56.604">う</span><span begin="1:56.604" end="1:57.172">な</span><span begin="1:57.172" end="1:57.884">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">能够实现</span></p><p begin="1:57.884" end="2:02.853" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.884" end="1:58.940">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.884" end="1:58.940">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.940" end="1:59.436">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">側</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.436" end="1:59.988">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.436" end="1:59.988">ば</span></span></span><span begin="1:59.988" end="2:00.460">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">眠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.460" end="2:01.476">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.460" end="2:01.476">む</span></span></span><span begin="2:01.476" end="2:01.711">ら</span><span begin="2:01.711" end="2:02.060">せ</span><span begin="2:02.060" end="2:02.580">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我愿在你身旁入眠</span></p><p begin="2:02.853" end="2:06.251" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.853" end="2:03.134">ど</span><span begin="2:03.134" end="2:03.415">ん</span><span begin="2:03.415" end="2:03.629">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">場</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.629" end="2:03.918">ば</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">所</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.918" end="2:04.325">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.325" end="2:04.629">で</span><span begin="2:04.629" end="2:04.955">も</span><span begin="2:04.955" end="2:05.211">い</span><span begin="2:05.211" end="2:05.467">い</span><span begin="2:05.467" end="2:06.251">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论你身处何方</span></p><p begin="2:06.251" end="2:09.372" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.251" end="2:08.171">Beautiful</span> <span begin="2:08.171" end="2:08.838">world</span></p><p begin="2:09.372" end="2:14.581" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">迷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.372" end="2:09.813">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.372" end="2:09.813">よ</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.813" end="2:10.083">わ</span><span begin="2:10.083" end="2:10.419">ず</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.419" end="2:11.419">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.419" end="2:11.419">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:11.419" end="2:11.851">だ</span><span begin="2:11.851" end="2:12.211">け</span><span begin="2:12.211" end="2:12.659">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.659" end="2:12.963">み</span></span></span><s